Package: zgrab2
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: curl, tar, make, git, golang
Section: security
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/zmap/zgrab2
Description: Fast modular L7 application-layer scanner
 zgrab2 is a fast, modular application-layer network scanner. It is
 commonly used with tools like ZMap which identify potential services
 on a given IP and port, which are then fed into zgrab2 to confirm and
 provide details of the service. It supports a number of protocols
 including SSH, HTTP, FTP, Telnet and more.
